       return _.find(this.theOffers, {currency_id, participant_group_id: null, country_id: null});\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\n### What is expected?\r\nBind the input value on the price attribute of the object returned by the findCurrencyOffer() function\r\n\r\n### What is actually happening?\r\nI get this error when compiling the code\r\n\r\nVueCompilerError: v-model value must be a valid JavaScript member expression.\r\n\r\n---\r\nSame code used to work with vue 2\r\n\r\nI saw that a similar issue was already opened https://github.com/vuejs/vue-next/issues/3910 and then closed due to a fix but that fix does not seem to solve my issue.\r\nIn the other issue the author is trying to access a 2D array directly within the v-model but in my case i'm using a function to return an object\r\n\r\n<!-- generated by vue-issues. DO NOT REMOVE -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/4072/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/4072/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/875456810","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/3993#issuecomment-875456810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/3993","id":875456810,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg3NTQ1NjgxMA==","user":{"login":"shadoWalker89","id":1449151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDkxNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1449151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadoWalker89","html_url":"https://github.com/shadoWalker89","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadoWalker89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadoWalker89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadoWalker89/gists{/gist_id}","starr